          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 596,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:2",
          "start": 556
        },
        "quote": "(b) “Crosswalk school speed zone” means:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.20.140 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "953930aa-a809-53d0-8561-3946777afdf9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 964,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:3",
          "start": 597
        },
        "quote": "(1) That portion of any through street where the speed limit is normally 30 miles per hour or less located within 150 feet, or where the speed limit is normally more than 30 miles per hour located within 250 feet, in either direction of a marked crosswalk associated with a public or private school building or schoolyard housing elementary or middle school students.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.20.140 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "165dc267-e2a3-5297-82ca-912c3d4a6457",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1205,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:4",
          "start": 965
        },
        "quote": "(2) The crosswalk school speed limit zones set out in this section shall not apply to those designated crosswalks across State highways or on streets where pedestrian-actuated traffic signals are installed to aid the pedestrian in crossing.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.20.140 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "1e714a87-5a71-51f6-8526-1b0a64d184e2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
