          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.140:block:5",
          "start": 1206
        },
        "quote": "For the purposes of this article, “school zone” means either an adjacent school speed zone or crosswalk school speed zone. (Ord. 17815 § 2, 4-9-02; Ord. 17190 § 1, 10-21-97. Code 1981 § 43-324. Code 1995 § 142-212.)",
